{"product_id":"iqos-terea-turquoise","title":"IQOS Terea Turquoise","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTurquoise Terea are intended for use with the IQOS ILUMA device and have a mild tobacco mix flavour with a spicy menthol finish. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41838507098167,"sku":"Terea Turquoise - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41838507130935,"sku":"Terea Turquoise - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-TEREA-Turquoise-carton.webp?v=1755831770","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-turquoise","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




